<description>&lt;p&gt;The Colombian government opened an embassy in Jerusalem and launched a cultural counterrevolution that is removing more than thirty artworks from the National Museum and ordering the removal of LGBTQ2S+ political works. The Mobile Anti-Riot Squad, a police unit implicated in multiple killings, has returned to operate in the country and a preacher was killed by a criminal group in Cartagena. An earthquake in Colombia has left more than 224 dead and rescue operations continue, while a Colombian asylum seeker was tackled by ICE agents outside his home in Washington. 225 battle-related deaths were recorded in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiXEFVX3lxTFB6b0l1MTZraDlwTWNoMG53STEyaDdxZDFvazJGektDNFo4M09pRmdzcFFPZkotYmZWcm96OVB1UGVKVXR3N0MtN0xtOHFTYUlpSmk3MkZaa1FEanVi?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Jerusalem Post&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMitgFBVV95cUxNVTJubnhqRW12amY5RFlwZnlGb195WTR6TmVBRHhCWk1EUmQ4YjVQNVExVENXNnFyQjB2bWtRODVCQU5WQlhReGlMYTZGTWZjcng4T1ZXOW4zUE83YTlvTTJ2SUFXOFZRcy1JeWxmOTNXb3RxNXFoVjBudVdGSEk1amtWMEx0ZzM3akxiaXl3R1FhaThPUHJManNTWVAtVGV0aERFSXpJTnpxaHYtdm1KMmtzT3NzQQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;Premier Christian News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;ABC4 Utah&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Peace Brigades International-Canada&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMirAFBVV95cUxOTE9NdUpaWXFNU3lQVkd6NHVKenRlVTRaZmc5NnNnOG5QX25MTGtqdHBxMmRya01xWDRmeWhKWVh4OXBaQ3BXMUN4dnlaNFQ4Z0ZOTmtIU09FbHZURW1VVW4yMUhUZTdSUnQxeVJxcTdrQXFHZ0hXQVczdE5oZ29zdXhLdXl4d1YtdnM0TWVfQmZKc2tRWlVPcnZuLUNpbzFDd0JWSV80NW9QSTg4?oc=5&quot;&gt;Eurasia Review&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;ABC7 Bay Area&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.co